{"ref":"BDB, לוֹטָן","hw":"לוֹטָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לוֹטָן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> 𝔊 Λωταν; a son of <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׂעִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:20\" href=\"/Genesis.36.20\">Gn 36:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:22\" href=\"/Genesis.36.22\">22</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.38\">1 Ch 1:38</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.39\">39</a>, and father of <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרִי</span> etc. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:22\" href=\"/Genesis.36.22\">Gn 36:22</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.39\">1 Ch 1:39</a>; called a chief <span dir=\"rtl\">(אַלּוּף)</span> of <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֹרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:29\" href=\"/Genesis.36.29\">Gn 36:29</a>.","next":"BDB, לֵוִי","prev":"BDB, לוֹט²"}